    'nizame-taleem',
    'Nizame-Taleem',
    'A school management system for day-to-day school operations.',
    'A school management system that brings admissions, staff, classes, fees, attendance, exams and reports into one place.',
    'Nizame-Taleem is a school management system that brings admissions, staff, classes, fees, attendance, exams and reports into one place for school administrators and staff. It is client work built with Ruby on Rails, React and Ant Design on one shared database, and Agentix founder Ahtasham Naeem worked on it as a full-stack developer.',
    'One system for school admin.',
    array['Web app', 'Rails', 'React']::text[],
    'Rails, React',
    'web-apps',
    'nizame-taleem',
    null,
    'Full-stack developer',
    'School administrators and staff',
    true,
    '[{"label":"Type","value":"School management system"},{"label":"Sector","value":"Education"},{"label":"Stack","value":"Rails, React, Ant Design"},{"label":"Built with","value":"Ruby on Rails and React"}]'::jsonb,
    '[{"icon":"users","title":"Admissions","text":"New students are admitted in one place."},{"icon":"book","title":"Staff and classes","text":"Staff records and classes are managed together."},{"icon":"card","title":"Fees","text":"Fees are managed in the same system."},{"icon":"check","title":"Attendance","text":"Daily attendance is tracked in the system."},{"icon":"calendar","title":"Exams","text":"Exams are managed in the same system."},{"icon":"chart","title":"Reports","text":"Reports are generated from the same data."}]'::jsonb,
    '[]'::jsonb,
    '[{"heading":"A school management system in one place","paragraphs":["Running a school means handling admissions, staff, classes, fees, attendance, exams and reports every day. When each of these lives in a separate register or spreadsheet, routine work takes longer and reports drift out of date.","Nizame-Taleem brings all seven areas into one school management system, built with Ruby on Rails, React and Ant Design. It is client work, and Agentix founder Ahtasham Naeem worked on it as a full-stack developer."]},{"heading":"Results for school staff","paragraphs":["Reported results after the system went live:"],"bullets":["About 2 days less admin work per week for each staff member","About 45% better report accuracy","Routine tasks done 80% faster"]},{"heading":"What each part of a school management system does","paragraphs":["Admissions keep a record of every applicant and new student. Staff and class records show who teaches what and where. Fees track what each family owes and has paid. Attendance records who was present each day, exams store marks, and reports pull all of this together for the school office and the leadership team.","When these parts share one database, a change in one place shows up everywhere. A new student added at admission already appears in class lists, fee records and attendance, so staff stop entering the same details again and again."]}]'::jsonb,
    '[{"question":"Which areas does Nizame-Taleem cover?","answer":"Admissions, staff, classes, fees, attendance, exams and reports."},{"question":"What changed for school staff?","answer":"Admin work dropped by about 2 days per week for each staff member, report accuracy improved by about 45%, and routine tasks became 80% faster."},{"question":"What is Nizame-Taleem built with?","answer":"Ruby on Rails, React.js and Ant Design."},{"question":"What was Agentix''s role on Nizame-Taleem?","answer":"Agentix founder Ahtasham Naeem worked on Nizame-Taleem as a full-stack developer, on both the Ruby on Rails back end and the React front end."},{"question":"Can you build a school management system for us?","answer":"Yes. Tell us how your school runs today and which areas you want in one place, and we will reply with a plan and a timeline."}]'::jsonb,
    '[{"src":"/projects/nizame-taleem/nizame-taleem-admission-form.webp","alt":"Nizame-Taleem student admission form with student information fields beside the school admin menu","caption":"Student admission form.","width":1521,"height":674,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRi4AAABXRUJQVlA4ICIAAACQAQCdASoKAAQAAsBMJaQAAudZtgAA/vmSTfZG3MSANbAA"},{"src":"/projects/nizame-taleem/nizame-taleem-employee-form.webp","alt":"Nizame-Taleem employee form with basic and other information fields","caption":"Staff registration form.","width":1521,"height":674,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRjIAAABXRUJQVlA4ICYAAACwAQCdASoKAAQAAsBMJaQAAuddPvgAAP75kk32Rf6ytWodg4AAAA=="},{"src":"/projects/nizame-taleem/nizame-taleem-student-attendance.webp","alt":"Nizame-Taleem screen to add or update student attendance, with date and class pickers and a card scanning tab","caption":"Marking student attendance.","width":1280,"height":567,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRiYAAABXRUJQVlA4IBoAAAAwAQCdASoKAAQAAsBMJaQAA3AA/vaI1BwAAA=="}]'::jsonb,
